We note that for fcc HEAs, there are several favored pairs, as it happens for our bcc HEA (seeFig. 2) and for most HEAs. Therefore, we consider that our analysis in terms of the fraction of various B2 phases, as shown in Fig. 9, provides an improved description. We show \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
