Returning to bcc HEAs, there is a recent study on 12 different alloys, using ab-initio simulations to obtain their elastic constants, and models to obtain their thermal properties from those33. This results in thermal conductivities in the range of 0.3–1.8 W/(Km), with the exception of two quaternary HEAs with higher conductivity. For instance, HfNbTiZrV has \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
