Machine learning was used to predict thermal conductivity versus temperature in alloys, based on chemical composition and a large training dataset with experimental conductivity values93. Such an approach would have to be enhanced for SRO alloys, given that chemical composition alone is not sufficient to determine \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
